msgstr "Loss functions define \"what makes a good prediction\", converting training into an optimization problem:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/loss-functions.md:316
msgid "**回归问题**：MSE光滑易优化，MAE鲁棒抗异常值"
msgstr "**Regression problems**: MSE is smooth and easy to optimize; MAE is robust against outliers"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/loss-functions.md:317
msgid "**分类问题**：交叉熵提供强梯度，是深度学习的主流选择"
msgstr "**Classification problems**: Cross-entropy provides strong gradients and is the mainstream choice in deep learning"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/loss-functions.md:318
msgid "**分布匹配**：KL散度衡量概率分布差异，VAE和知识蒸馏的核心工具"
msgstr "**Distribution matching**: KL divergence measures probability distribution discrepancies, serving as a core tool in VAEs and knowledge distillation"

